  <jpcrp_cor:TreasurySharesEtcTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
&lt;h5 class="smt_head4" style="padding-left:22.5pt;"&gt;②&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt; 【自己株式等】&lt;/span&gt;
